---
layout: index_layout.njk
title: Al-Anon Meeting Schedule Ames Iowa
# Keep the home page footer date tied to this file's modification time.
date: Last Modified
description: Find an Al-Anon meeting in Ames Iowa USA. Al-Anon is a support group for friends and family members of alcoholics. Many meetings are held weekly in Ames Iowa USA.
pagination:
  data: collections.sortedPosts
  size: 7
  alias: items
---

<main class="section is-flex-grow-1" data-meeting-swipe>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="columns is-variable is-4-desktop is-multiline is-mobile">
      {% for item in items %}
        <div class="column is-one-third-tablet is-full-mobile mb-5">
          {% include "tarjetaCard.njk" %}
        </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>

    {# These marked links power both the visible buttons and the shared swipe handler. (2026-09-30) #}
    {% set meetingLinks = collections.meetingNavigationPages | meetingNavigation(page.url) %}
    {% if meetingLinks.previous or meetingLinks.next %}
      <nav class="level is-mobile mt-5" data-meeting-navigation aria-label="Page navigation">
        <div class="level-left">
          {% if meetingLinks.previous %}
            <a class="button is-light" href="{{ meetingLinks.previous.url }}" rel="prev" data-meeting-previous aria-label="Previous page: {{ meetingLinks.previous.data.title }}">Previous page</a>
          {% elif page.url == "/" %}
            {# Home starts the sequence, so Previous wraps to the final page, Events. (2026-09-30) #}
            <a class="button is-light" href="/Events/" rel="prev" data-meeting-previous aria-label="Previous page: Upcoming Local Events">Previous page</a>
          {% endif %}
        </div>
        <div class="level-right">
          {% if meetingLinks.next %}
            <a class="button is-light" href="{{ meetingLinks.next.url }}" rel="next" data-meeting-next aria-label="Next page: {{ meetingLinks.next.data.title }}">Next page</a>
          {% endif %}
        </div>
      </nav>
    {% endif %}

    {# No need for the 2 pagination arrows if there is only one page of items. Ed H removed 5/9/2026 #}
    {#
     <div class="columns">
      <div class="column has-text-centered">
        {% include "pagination.njk" %}  
      </div>
    </div>
    #}

  </div>
</main>